  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Locally-led Multi-Purpose Cash Response to Affected Communities in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide a coordinated and harmonized Multi-purpose Cash response to meet the basic needs of communities, mainly internally displaced persons, affected by climatic shocks in the ASAL Counties in Northern Kenya. ACTED works through the ASAL Humanitarian Network (AHN). AHN partners will target 2,564 households (15,384 individuals) in Tana-River, Garissa and Baringo Counties with three cycles of cash assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
